    {
      "id": "central-claim",
      "claim_type": "author-claim",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        {
          "source_id": "paper",
          "locator": "Introduction and Figure 2: self-improvement loop"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "Self-Harness 让当前模型读自己的失败轨迹、概括反复出现的机制，再提交最小修改；如果修改让任一 split 提升且两个 split 都不退，才进入下一轮。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "method",
      "claim_type": "author-claim",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper",
        "official-artifact"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        {
          "source_id": "paper",
          "locator": "Method: Weakness Mining, Proposal, and Validation; acceptance equation"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "official-artifact",
          "locator": "Commit 2720dbb3f52283684f4b85a1065d642df1779dd8: candidate evaluation and promotion"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "一轮分三步：从轨迹提取 weakness signature，并行提出互异的最小 edit，再用 held-in / held-out 双重门验证。"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "accept(e) ⇔ held-in(e) ≥ baseline ∧ held-out(e) ≥ baseline ∧ 至少一边严格提升"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "results",
      "claim_type": "author-claim",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        {
          "source_id": "paper",
          "locator": "Table 1 and Figures 4–20: nine configurations and retained edits"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "MiniMax M2.5、Qwen3.5-35B-A3B、GLM-5 在 Terminal-Bench 2.0、SWE-bench Verified、AppWorld 的九种组合都在两个 gate split 上提高。"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "最大绝对变化是 GLM-5 在 AppWorld 从 44.4% 到 85.0%。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "limitations",
      "claim_type": "interpretation",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        {
          "source_id": "paper",
          "locator": "Validation procedure and Table 1: both splits participate in promotion"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "名为 held-out 的 split 每轮都会参与 candidate promotion。它实际是搜索期 validation / regression set，不是最终只看一次的 blind test。"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "结论应读成“对未用于 weakness mining 的回归集也提升”，而不是完全独立的最终泛化证明。"
        }
      ]
    }
